            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Ah. Forgot the `{ remap = true }`. So the following works:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<leader>cx\", \"<leader>ciaf)\", { desc = \"(wrap)\", remap = true })\r\n```\r\n",
